======================================================================
KEY DIFFERENCES FROM ORIGINAL VERSION:
======================================================================

ORIGINAL APPROACH:
  • Baseline = pooled KDE on all 2007-2024 data
  • Dashed lines ≠ arithmetic mean of visible points
  • Heatmap values relative to pooled baseline

REVISED APPROACH:
  • Baseline = arithmetic mean of six period values
  • Dashed lines = arithmetic mean of visible points
  • Heatmap values relative to arithmetic mean
  • Changes now sum to ≈0 for each age group

VISUAL CONSISTENCY:
  • Line plot and heatmap now use SAME baseline definition
  • Dashed lines directly interpretable from data
  • Percentage changes balanced around zero

