Interpretation:
- R (Mean Resultant Length): 0-1 scale
  * R close to 1: All vectors point in nearly same direction (consistent)
  * R close to 0: Vectors point in many different directions (dispersed)
- Circular SD: Angular spread in degrees
  * Low values: Tight angular clustering
  * High values: Wide angular spread


